DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       cchhddiirr() changes the current working directory of the calling process to
       the directory specified in _p_a_t_h.

       ffcchhddiirr()  is  identical to cchhddiirr(); the only difference is that the di‐
       rectory is given as an open file descriptor.

