       The  current  working  directory is the starting point for interpreting
       relative pathnames (those not starting with '/').

       A child process created via ffoorrkk(2) inherits its parent’s current work‐
       ing directory.  The current working directory is left unchanged by  eexx‐‐
       eeccvvee(2).

